cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these OpenStudio Measures in your research or teaching, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "energyplus-tools: OpenStudio Measures for Building Energy Simulation"
abstract: >-
  A collection of Python OpenStudio Measures, tested with OpenStudio 3.11.0 and
  EnergyPlus 25.2.0, that add modelling options not available in the OpenStudio
  Application: ground heat transfer methods (Site:GroundTemperature:BuildingSurface,
  F/C-factor method and Kiva) and heat recovery, economizer and demand-controlled
  ventilation for ideal loads air systems.
authors:
